### ============================================
### PART C — SECURE (method=safe)
### ============================================

### ✅ Test C1: Legitimate Request (safe) → expect 1 row
GET {{server}}/odata/v4/admin/fetchCustomer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic {{username}}:{{password}}

{
  "customerID": "1004100",
  "method": "safe"
}

### 🛡️ Test C2: Injection attempt (safe) → expect 0 rows (treated as literal parameter)
GET {{server}}/odata/v4/admin/fetchCustomer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic {{username}}:{{password}}

{
  "customerID": "1004100' OR '1'='1",
  "method": "safe"
}

### 🛡️ Test C3: Multi-statement attempt (safe) → expect 0 rows (treated as literal parameter)
GET {{server}}/odata/v4/admin/fetchCustomer(customerID='1004100''; DELETE FROM sap_capire_incidents_Customers;--',method='safe')
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
